# Security headers for the site's static pages (docs/security.md). Draft previews set their own.
# cloudflareinsights.com: Cloudflare Web Analytics (D-042), loaded only when a site has a token.
# youtube-nocookie.com, player.vimeo.com: video players (D-046), framed only after a visitor
# presses play (VIDEO_FRAME_ORIGINS in packages/sections).
# blob: images and connections and the one style-src hash are the 3D viewer's (D-057): it reads a
# model's textures from blob: addresses, and the hash allows exactly its own stylesheet
# (@google/model-viewer 4.4.0; the dashboard's and the site's browser tests fail if an upgrade
# changes it).
/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' https://challenges.cloudflare.com https://static.cloudflareinsights.com; frame-src https://challenges.cloudflare.com https://www.youtube-nocookie.com https://player.vimeo.com; connect-src 'self' blob: https://cloudflareinsights.com; img-src 'self' data: blob:; style-src 'self' 'sha256-PXtZZkJMMyc18o/DN1ZEFOJ2qEGq95IQbVaJFMOXOb0='; font-src 'self'; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'; upgrade-insecure-requests
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=()
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin

/_astro/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/fonts/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

# Site search (D-052): Pagefind compiles its WebAssembly search code in the page and in a worker.
# Only the search pages and Pagefind's own files allow that ('wasm-unsafe-eval', nothing else);
# every other page keeps the policy above. Keep the three policies in step with it
# (src/headers.test.ts checks this).
/search/
  ! Content-Security-Policy
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'wasm-unsafe-eval' https://challenges.cloudflare.com https://static.cloudflareinsights.com; frame-src https://challenges.cloudflare.com https://www.youtube-nocookie.com https://player.vimeo.com; connect-src 'self' blob: https://cloudflareinsights.com; img-src 'self' data: blob:; style-src 'self' 'sha256-PXtZZkJMMyc18o/DN1ZEFOJ2qEGq95IQbVaJFMOXOb0='; font-src 'self'; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'; upgrade-insecure-requests

